ire benefits.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Project UD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Project UD </strong>is being developed by a small team that loves a variety of Co-op multiplayer games, dungeon crawlers, and loot shooters. If you enjoyed <strong>Project Zomboid, Risk of Rain, the Diablo series, Strange Dungeon series</strong> and <strong>Darkest Dungeon series</strong>, Project UD will give you the pleasure of a unique new combination of the dungeon crawler genre in the cosmic horror urban fantasy world.</p>", "short_description": "Project UD combines extraction games and pixel art to create a new action experience. Explore a city surrounded by abnormal phenomena, overcome monsters and traps, complete missions, and acquire loot. If you work together with friends, you can deal with many more threats.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532460/header.jpg?t=1774579659", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532460/f9696592c580db99acb7cbe099986c64e2718036/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774579659", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532460/f9696592c580db99acb7cbe099986c64e2718036/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774579659", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows® 10 / 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen™ 3 1200 / Intel® Core™ i3-6100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon™ RX 460 / NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 750<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul clas